# =====================================================================
# Release V128 -- Day Book action counts onto the practitioners dimension
# =====================================================================
# Supersedes the interim vw_Dim_Site_Practitioner_Current (V127). Gold.vw_Dim_Practitioners adds the
# Day Book action counts (Open Plans / Cancellations to rebook / DNAs to rebook / Recalls to action +
# Days-until-30-min text) as columns on List Practitioners itself, summed to practitioner grain from
# the GOLD_AGG Aggregate_Site_Practitioner_Current. The diary matrix then anchors its Rows on
# List Practitioners[Full Name] -- the field every fact and every Day Book drill-through page already
# keys on -- with the counts riding along as columns on the SAME table. No second practitioner
# dimension and no cross-dimension relationship (which would pollute filter propagation model-wide),
# so drill-through fires and no other report is affected.
#
# MIGRATE drops the interim views. Meta.usp_Create_Gold_Views wraps vw_Dim_Practitioners into
# PBI.[List Practitioners] (superseding the table's own view).
#
# MODEL (user, in Desktop): matrix Rows = List Practitioners[Full Name] + the new count columns
# (all on List Practitioners now); drill-through buttons work unchanged.
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V128__day_book_counts_onto_practitioners.manifest -SkipTests
# =====================================================================

MIGRATE  Migrations\V128__day_book_counts_onto_practitioners.sql
DEPLOY   Fabric\Gold.vw_Dim_Practitioners.View.sql
EXEC     EXEC Meta.usp_Create_Gold_Views;

TEST
